e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −4 to +4 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1970","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-minnesota-vikings","name":"Minnesota Vikings","code":"MIN","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 204)","str":86.8,"squad":[["Gary Cuozzo","QB",84],["Bob Lee","QB",72],["Dave Osborn","RB",90],["Clint Jones","RB",82],["Gene Washington","WR",92],["John Henderson","WR",79],["Bob Grim","WR",78],["John Beasley","TE",79],["Kent Kramer","TE",56],["Mick Tingelhoff","OL",94],["Milt Sunde","OL",94],["Ron Yary","OL",94],["Grady Alderman","OL",71],["Jim Vellone","OL",68],["Ed White","OL",67],["Doug Davis","OL",64],["Alan Page","DL",99],["Carl Eller","DL",96],["Jim Marshall","DL",86],["Gary Larsen","DL",85],["Paul Dickson","DL",67],["John Ward","DL",64],["Lonnie Warwick","LB",91],["Roy Winston","LB",91],["Wally Hilgenberg","LB",90],["Ed Sharockman","CB",94],["Bobby Bryant","CB",76],["Charlie West","CB",70],["Ted Provost","CB",62],["Paul Krause","S",94],["Karl Kassulke","S",93],["Dale Hackbart","S",62],["Fred Cox","K",99]]},{"id":"nfl-detroit-lions","name":"Detroit Lions","code":"DET","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 263)","str":86.2,"squad":[["Greg Landry","QB",86],["Bill Munson","QB",77],["Mel Farr","RB",92],["Altie Taylor","RB",90],["Larry Walton","WR",82],["Earl McCullouch","WR",77],["Chuck Hughes","WR",74],["Charlie Brown","WR",64],["Charlie Sanders","TE",89],["Craig Cotton","TE",53],["Chuck Walton","OL",97],["Ed Flanagan","